{"2834670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Fibers", "steam_appid": 2834670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a miracle of modern science ended in global catastrophe. The <strong>Dead Fiber Virus</strong> was first dismissed as a lab accident—until it spread faster than containment efforts could follow. Entire cities fell within days. Governments pointed fingers, calling it <strong>biological warfare</strong>, and soon nations turned their weapons on each other. Nuclear fire finished what the virus began.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the world lies in ruins—charred cities crawling with <strong>Fiber-infected</strong>, the dead whose nervous systems have been hijacked by the virus’s synthetic tendrils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this broken world, survival has a price. You play as a <strong>mercenary</strong>, taking on high-risk missions in zones overrun by the infected—retrieving data, rescuing survivors, and hunting for lost technology. You don’t fight for ideals. You fight for <strong>pay</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No area is too deadly, no job too impossible—<strong>as long as the money’s right</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a sandbox action/horror experience where survival is paramount. Navigate through stunning and diverse locations while mastering stealth, utilizing a variety of melee and ranged weapons, gadgets, and grenade types.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a miracle of modern science ended in global catastrophe. The <strong>Dead Fiber Virus</strong> was first dismissed as a lab accident—until it spread faster than containment efforts could follow. Entire cities fell within days. Governments pointed fingers, calling it <strong>biological warfare</strong>, and soon nations turned their weapons on each other. Nuclear fire finished what the virus began.</p><p class=\"bb_para